্ষতি হ’লেও শপত ৰক্ষা কৰে,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"যি জনে সুদ নলোৱাকৈ ধাৰ দিয়ে,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"আৰু ভেঁটি লৈ নিৰ্দ্দোষীৰ ক্ষতি নকৰে।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"যি সকলে এইবোৰ কৰ্ম কৰে, তেওঁলোক সকলো সময়তে স্থিৰে থাকিব।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}